      "side": 1,
      "message": "My comment was on 753-755 in patchset 1.\n\nMaking these buttons mutually exclusive is interesting... Do we ever want to have a recovery button on a device which has volume buttons? Recovery button is also used for user confirmation on dev mode transition for Fizz but I assume other keyboard-less devices have other ways to process user confirmation.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 737,
